    "reason": "The release note [ev-e4abe53a35a3] only names an internal method, the APIEstablisher validate method, which now mutates MRDs the way it already mutates CRDs. The linked PR [ev-bf1c7c178c51, ev-75fb02c22981] adds that the new MRD is converted from unstructured to a typed object. It also shows CLI output where one provider-kubernetes MRD has ESTABLISHED=Unknown, but the excerpt is cut off and never says whether that output is the bug or the fixed result. The changed files [ev-d4983d52cf2d] (MRD types, the MRD CRD schema, and an e2e manifest called mrd-defaulted.yaml) suggest something about defaulting changed. None of this says which field or behaviour changed, what it was before and after, which environments are exposed, or what happens to an operator who does nothing. The full PR description or diff showing the before/after behaviour is still needed.",
